\": \"<Respond to the Question 1 with the corresponding letter numbering>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<Respond to the Question 2 with the corresponding letter numbering>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## Scenario\nEvery evening, Alexa used to water her vegetable garden, which was in the backyard of her home. One evening, a group of children playing soccer in the nearby ground accidentally kicked the ball into her garden, damaging some of her plants. Alexa destroyed their ball to show her anger. The following afternoon, she saw the children arrive with new plants, apologizing for their actions and asking if they could have their ball back.\n\n## Question 1\nWhat emotion(s) would Alexa ultimately feel in this situation?\n\n## Choices for Question 1\nA) Gratitude & Joy\nB) Anger & Gratitude\nC) Anger & Disapproval\nD) Joy & Hopeless\nE) Disapproval & Joy\nF) Gratitude & Guilt\n\n## Question 2\nWhy would Alexa feel these emotions in this situation?\n\n## Choices for Question 2\nA) She doesn't like soccer & The kids asked for their ball back\nB) The children apologized and offered to replace the plants & She destroyed the children's soccer ball\nC) She appreciates the children respecting her personal space & The kids asked for their ball back\nD) The children apologized and offered to replace the plants & The children stopped playing\nE) The children apologized and offered to replace the plants & The kids asked for their ball back\nF) She destroyed the children's soccer ball & The kids asked for their ball back","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.01243164829198241,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5a7b39aa9dc5a833da02d","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794484147415,"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:49:07","d